1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:03,348
Vanuatu: five things you must do once.

2
00:00:03,868 --> 00:00:04,291
One.

3
00:00:04,311 --> 00:00:08,495
Watch the lava of Mount Yasur at dusk.

4
00:00:09,015 --> 00:00:09,214
Two.

5
00:00:09,234 --> 00:00:12,722
See a land dive on Pentecost,
every Saturday from April to June.

6
00:00:13,242 --> 00:00:13,755
Three.

7
00:00:13,775 --> 00:00:15,888
Drink kava at a nakamal.

8
00:00:16,408 --> 00:00:16,728
Four.

9
00:00:16,748 --> 00:00:21,629
Swim in a blue hole, then walk
on the squeaking sand of Champagne Beach.

10
00:00:22,149 --> 00:00:22,448
Five.

11
00:00:22,468 --> 00:00:25,643
Snorkel over the machines
of Million Dollar Point.

12
00:00:26,163 --> 00:00:27,425
Which one would you do first?

